        <h2>Order Ahead and Pick Up Curbside</h2>
        <p>The smartest lake move is ordering before you leave the house. Place your order online, choose curbside pickup at Lakeway, and we'll have everything bagged and cold when you pull up; no circling the parking lot with a boat trailer. Delivery is available too, handy when the lake house has everything except the one thing everybody wanted. Delivery area and details are on our <a href="/delivery.html">delivery page</a>. Someone 21 or older with a valid ID has to receive the order either way.</p>

        <h2>On the East Side? We've Got You Too</h2>
        <p>If you're on the other end of town, our <a href="/east-austin.html">East Austin store</a> is at 1902 E. Martin Luther King Jr. Blvd, Austin, TX 78702, on the corner of MLK and Chicon, next to JuiceLand, Austin Daily Press, and The Wheel. Same hours, same family, same phone number. It stocks the same lake essentials and makes a quick stop before the drive out.</p>
        <p>Both stores are run by the same father-and-son team that opened Monarch in 2020. Ask us what's cold, what's new, or what goes with brisket at a lake house. Recommending the right thing is genuinely the best part of the job. Our <a href="/faq.html">FAQ</a> covers the rest.</p>

        <h2>Lake Travis Liquor Store FAQ</h2>
        <h3>Is there a liquor store open on Sunday near Lake Travis?</h3>
        <p>No. Texas law closes all package (liquor) stores on Sunday, so no liquor store near Lake Travis is open that day. Grocery and convenience stores can sell beer and wine on Sunday under different rules. Stock up Saturday before 9pm.</p>
        <h3>Can I drink on a boat on Lake Travis?</h3>
        <p>Passengers 21 and over can generally drink on a boat in Texas, but the person operating the boat is subject to boating-while-intoxicated laws with the same limit as driving a car. Many parks and marinas also restrict glass. Check TABC and Texas Parks and Wildlife for the specifics.</p>
        <h3>Does Monarch Liquor deliver to Lakeway and Lake Travis?</h3>
        <p>Yes, we offer delivery and curbside pickup from our Lakeway store through our online ordering site. Coverage area and details are listed on our delivery page, and someone 21+ with a valid ID must be present to receive the order.</p>
